@startuml UML-PUBLICATION-ACQUISITION-FLOW
title Publication Acquisition Flow
actor User
participant "Local Library" as Local
participant "Library Engine" as Library
participant "KnowledgeOS Server" as Server
participant "Import Engine" as Import
participant "Workflow Engine" as Workflow
User -> Local: Browse Master Catalog
Local -> Server: Query catalog
Server --> Local: Publication summaries
User -> Library: Acquire publication
Library -> Workflow: Start idempotent acquisition
Workflow -> Server: Download selected payload
Server --> Workflow: Source + identity + provenance
Workflow -> Import: Validate and register source
Import --> Workflow: Validated import manifest
Workflow -> Library: Commit Local membership
Library --> User: Available offline
@enduml
